# Build and test output
/dist/
*.test
*.out
*.prof

# testdata/fuzz/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The generated corpus lives in
# the build cache; what lands under testdata/ is a minimised reproducer for
# an input that actually failed, and committing it turns that failure into a
# regression test the ordinary `go test` run replays for ever.

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
